cimport_form.aye:5:5: error[E0112]: a `@cimport` cannot be `pub`: export Aye functions that wrap the C ones instead
cimport_form.aye:6:1: error[E0112]: a `@cimport` is named with `let`: `let b = @cimport(...)`
cimport_form.aye:7:8: error[E0112]: a `@cimport` has no type: `let c = @cimport(...)`
cimport_form.aye:8:9: error[E0112]: `@cimport` needs a header: `@cimport("zlib.h")`
cimport_form.aye:9:18: error[E0112]: `@cimport` takes string literals: the header, then flags (`@cimport("zlib.h", "-DZ_PREFIX")`)
